  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Genera4: loan for the construction of Biogas Plants in Chile</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to finance the construction of biogas plants in various regions of Chile. These plants will convert organic waste into biogas&#x2014;which can be used as thermal energy, electricity, or fuel&#x2014;and will also produce digestate, a natural fertilizer for agricultural use.The project aims to promote sustainable infrastructure, foster the circular economy, and diversify the country&#x2019;s energy matrix through the use of renewable sources.</narrative>
  </description>
